---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About | Superdots" description="About Superdots — practical AI guides for every department.">
	<div class="about-header">
		<div class="dots dots-xl" style="top: -8%; right: -2%;"></div>
		<div class="dots dots-md dots-fine" style="bottom: 0; left: 2%;"></div>
		<div class="dots dots-sm dots-brand" style="top: 30%; left: -5%;"></div>
		<p class="about-label">
			<span class="superdot"></span>
			About us
		</p>
		<h1>AI guides that respect your time<span class="dot-accent">.</span></h1>
	</div>
	<div class="prose">
		<p>
			We believe AI should help people work better, not replace them.
			Superdots publishes practical, no-fluff guides on how AI can help
			employees in every department — from engineering to HR, from finance
			to marketing.
		</p>
		<p>
			Every article focuses on real techniques you can apply today.
			No hype, no jargon walls, no "10x your productivity" promises —
			just clear, tested approaches to using AI tools at work.
		</p>

		<h2>What we cover</h2>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Automation</strong> — streamline repetitive tasks</li>
			<li><strong>Analysis</strong> — make better decisions with data</li>
			<li><strong>Writing</strong> — draft, edit, and communicate faster</li>
			<li><strong>Communication</strong> — collaborate more effectively</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Who this is for</h2>
		<p>
			Anyone who works. Whether you're an engineer, a marketer, a sales rep,
			or an HR manager — if you use a computer at work, there's an AI tool
			that can save you hours every week. We'll show you how.
		</p>
	</div>
</Base>

<style>
	.about-header {
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		padding: var(--space-8) 0 var(--space-4);
	}
	.about-label {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: var(--space-2);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		color: var(--color-primary);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
	}
	.about-label .superdot {
		width: 8px;
		height: 8px;
		background: var(--color-primary);
		border-radius: var(--radius-full);
		display: inline-block;
	}
	.about-header h1 {
		margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
	}
	.dot-accent {
		color: var(--color-primary);
	}
	.prose {
		max-width: var(--max-width-prose);
		line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
	}
	.prose h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		margin-top: var(--space-10);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
	}
	.prose ul {
		padding-left: var(--space-6);
	}
	.prose li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5em;
	}
	.prose li::marker {
		color: var(--color-primary);
	}
	.prose strong {
		color: var(--color-text-strong);
	}
</style>
